   "result": "import unittest\n\nfrom money import Money\n\n\nclass T(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_add(self):\n        self.assertEqual(Money(150) + Money(275), Money(425))\n\n    def test_str(self):\n        self.assertEqual(str(Money(5)), '$0.05')\n        self.assertEqual(str(Money(123456)), '$1,234.56')\n        self.assertEqual(str(Money(-250)), '-$2.50')\n\n    def test_split(self):\n        self.assertEqual(Money(100).split(3), [Money(34), Money(33), Money(33)])\n        self.assertEqual(sum((m.cents for m in Money(7).split(4))), 7)\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    unittest.main()\n"
